Package: aethertheme
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Venom Project <venom@example.com>
Installed-Size: 320
Depends: libgtk-3-0 (>= 3.22.0), libglib2.0-0 (>= 2.50.0), libjson-glib-1.0-0, libxcursor1
Section: gnome
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/VAXPAPPS/AetherTheme
Description: GTK3 Theme Manager — Customizes GTK3 look and feel settings
 AetherTheme is a GTK3 theme manager that integrates with the\n Venom desktop environment. It reads color settings from\n ~/.config/venom/settings.vaxp and applies them in real-time\n without requiring an application restart.
